// composed on the rhythm of a theme from voidchip. Computed parts: a counter-melody from the chords, a canon, a run up to the dominant in every build-up, the theme at half speed in the outro.
// It is an ordinary song file: change anything; the melodies can be drawn in the piano roll (P).
